{"book":"John","chapter":5,"translation":"KJV","url":"/bible/john/5","verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"After this there was a feast of the Jews; and Jesus went up to Jerusalem.","words":[["After",["G3326"]],["this",["G5023"]],["there was",["G2258"]],["a feast",["G1859"]],["of the Jews;",["G2453"]],["and",["G2532"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["went up",["G305"]],["to",["G1519"]],["Jerusalem.",[]]]},{"verse":2,"text":"Now there is at Jerusalem by the sheep market a pool, which is called in the Hebrew tongue Bethesda, having five porches.","words":[["Now",["G1161"]],["there is",["G2076"]],["at",["G1722"]],["Jerusalem",["G2414"]],["by",["G1909"]],["the sheep",["G4262"]],["market a pool,",["G2861"]],["which",["G3588"]],["is called",["G1951"]],["in the Hebrew tongue",["G1447"]],["Bethesda,",["G964"]],["having",["G2192"]],["five",["G4002"]],["porches.",[]]]},{"verse":3,"text":"In these lay a great multitude of impotent folk, of blind, halt, withered, waiting for the moving of the water.","words":[["In",["G1722"]],["these",["G5025"]],["lay",["G2621"]],["a great",["G4183"]],["multitude",["G4128"]],["of impotent folk,",["G770"]],["of blind,",["G5185"]],["halt,",["G5560"]],["withered,",["G3584"]],["waiting for",["G1551"]],["the moving",["G2796"]],["of the water.",[]]]},{"verse":4,"text":"For an angel went down at a certain season into the pool, and troubled the water: whosoever then first after the troubling of the water stepped in was made whole of whatsoever disease he had.","words":[["For",["G1063"]],["an angel",["G32"]],["went down",["G2597"]],["at",["G2596"]],["a certain season",["G2540"]],["into",["G1722"]],["the pool,",["G2861"]],["and",["G2532"]],["troubled",["G5015"]],["the water:",["G5204"]],["whosoever then",["G3767"]],["first",["G4413"]],["after",["G3326"]],["the troubling",["G5016"]],["of the water",["G5204"]],["stepped in",["G1684"]],["was made",["G1096"]],["whole",["G5199"]],["of",["G3739"]],["whatsoever",["G1221"]],["disease",["G3553"]],["he had.",[]]]},{"verse":5,"text":"And a certain man was there, which had an infirmity thirty and eight years.","words":[["And",["G1161"]],["a certain",["G5100"]],["man",["G444"]],["was",["G2258"]],["there,",["G1563"]],["which had",["G2192"]],["an infirmity",["G1722","G769"]],["thirty",["G5144"]],["and eight",["G3638"]],["years.",[]]]},{"verse":6,"text":"When Jesus saw him lie, and knew that he had been now a long time in that case, he saith unto him, Wilt thou be made whole?","words":[["When Jesus",["G2424"]],["saw",["G1492"]],["him",["G5126"]],["lie,",["G2621"]],["and",["G2532"]],["knew",["G1097"]],["that",["G3754"]],["he had been",["G2192"]],["now",["G2235"]],["a long",["G4183"]],["time",["G5550"]],["in that case, he saith",["G3004"]],["unto him,",["G846"]],["Wilt thou",["G2309"]],["be made",["G1096"]],["whole?",[]]]},{"verse":7,"text":"The impotent man answered him, Sir, I have no man, when the water is troubled, to put me into the pool: but while I am coming, another steppeth down before me.","words":[["The impotent man",["G770"]],["answered",["G611"]],["him,",["G846"]],["Sir,",["G2962"]],["I have",["G2192"]],["no",["G3756"]],["man,",["G444"]],["when",["G3752"]],["the water",["G5204"]],["is troubled,",["G5015"]],["to",["G2443"]],["put",["G906"]],["me",["G3165"]],["into",["G1519"]],["the pool:",["G2861"]],["but",["G1161"]],["while",["G1722","G3739"]],["I",["G1473"]],["am coming,",["G2064"]],["another",["G243"]],["steppeth down",["G2597"]],["before",["G4253"]],["me.",[]]]},{"verse":8,"text":"Jesus saith unto him, Rise, take up thy bed, and walk.","words":[["Jesus",["G2424"]],["saith",["G3004"]],["unto him,",["G846"]],["Rise,",["G1453"]],["take up",["G142"]],["thy",["G4675"]],["bed,",["G2895"]],["and",["G2532"]],["walk.",[]]]},{"verse":9,"text":"And immediately the man was made whole, and took up his bed, and walked: and on the same day was the sabbath.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["immediately",["G2112"]],["the man",["G444"]],["was made",["G1096"]],["whole,",["G5199"]],["and",["G2532"]],["took up",["G142"]],["his",["G846"]],["bed,",["G2895"]],["and",["G2532"]],["walked:",["G4043"]],["and",["G1161"]],["on",["G1722"]],["the same",["G1565"]],["day",["G2250"]],["was",["G2258"]],["the sabbath.",[]]]},{"verse":10,"text":"The Jews therefore said unto him that was cured, It is the sabbath day: it is not lawful for thee to carry thy bed.","words":[["The Jews",["G2453"]],["therefore",["G3767"]],["said",["G3004"]],["unto him that was cured,",["G2323"]],["It is",["G2076"]],["the sabbath day:",["G4521"]],["it is",["G1832"]],["not",["G3756"]],["lawful",["G1832"]],["for thee",["G4671"]],["to carry",["G142"]],["thy bed.",[]]]},{"verse":11,"text":"He answered them, He that made me whole, the same said unto me, Take up thy bed, and walk.","words":[["He answered",["G611"]],["them,",["G846"]],["He that made",["G4160"]],["me",["G3165"]],["whole,",["G5199"]],["the same",["G1565"]],["said",["G2036"]],["unto me,",["G3427"]],["Take up",["G142"]],["thy",["G4675"]],["bed,",["G2895"]],["and",["G2532"]],["walk.",[]]]},{"verse":12,"text":"Then asked they him, What man is that which said unto thee, Take up thy bed, and walk?","words":[["Then",["G3767"]],["asked they",["G2065"]],["him,",["G846"]],["What",["G5101"]],["man",["G444"]],["is",["G2076"]],["that which",["G3588"]],["said",["G2036"]],["unto thee,",["G4671"]],["Take up",["G142"]],["thy",["G4675"]],["bed,",["G2895"]],["and",["G2532"]],["walk?",[]]]},{"verse":13,"text":"And he that was healed wist not who it was: for Jesus had conveyed himself away, a multitude being in that place.","words":[["And",["G1161"]],["he that was healed",["G2390"]],["wist",["G1492"]],["not",["G3756"]],["who",["G5101"]],["it was:",["G2076"]],["for",["G1063"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["had conveyed himself away,",["G1593"]],["a multitude",["G3793"]],["being",["G5607"]],["in",["G1722"]],["that place.",[]]]},{"verse":14,"text":"Afterward Jesus findeth him in the temple, and said unto him, Behold, thou art made whole: sin no more, lest a worse thing come unto thee.","words":[["Afterward",["G3326","G5023"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["findeth",["G2147"]],["him",["G846"]],["in",["G1722"]],["the temple,",["G2411"]],["and",["G2532"]],["said",["G2036"]],["unto him,",["G846"]],["Behold,",["G2396"]],["thou art made",["G1096"]],["whole:",["G5199"]],["sin",["G264"]],["no more,",["G3371"]],["lest",["G3363"]],["a worse thing",["G5501","G5100"]],["come",["G1096"]],["unto thee.",[]]]},{"verse":15,"text":"The man departed, and told the Jews that it was Jesus, which had made him whole.","words":[["The man",["G444"]],["departed,",["G565"]],["and",["G2532"]],["told",["G312"]],["the Jews",["G2453"]],["that",["G3754"]],["it was",["G2076"]],["Jesus,",["G2424"]],["which",["G3588"]],["had made",["G4160"]],["him",["G846"]],["whole.",[]]]},{"verse":16,"text":"And therefore did the Jews persecute Jesus, and sought to slay him, because he had done these things on the sabbath day.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["therefore",["G1223","G5124"]],["did",["G1377"]],["the Jews",["G2453"]],["persecute",["G1377"]],["Jesus,",["G2424"]],["and",["G2532"]],["sought",["G2212"]],["to slay",["G615"]],["him,",["G846"]],["because",["G3754"]],["he had done",["G4160"]],["these things",["G5023"]],["on",["G1722"]],["the sabbath day.",[]]]},{"verse":17,"text":"But Jesus answered them, My Father worketh hitherto, and I work.","words":[["But",["G1161"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["answered",["G611"]],["them,",["G846"]],["My",["G3450"]],["Father",["G3962"]],["worketh",["G2038"]],["hitherto,",["G2193","G737"]],["and I",["G2504"]],["work.",[]]]},{"verse":18,"text":"Therefore the Jews sought the more to kill him, because he not only had broken the sabbath, but said also that God was his Father, making himself equal with God.","words":[["Therefore",["G1223","G5124","G3767"]],["the Jews",["G2453"]],["sought",["G2212"]],["the more",["G3123"]],["to kill",["G615"]],["him,",["G846"]],["because",["G3754"]],["he",["G3089"]],["not",["G3756"]],["only",["G3440"]],["had broken",["G3089"]],["the sabbath,",["G4521"]],["but",["G235"]],["said",["G3004"]],["also",["G2532"]],["that God",["G2316"]],["was his",["G2398"]],["Father,",["G3962"]],["making",["G4160"]],["himself",["G1438"]],["equal",["G2470"]],["with God.",[]]]},{"verse":19,"text":"Then answered Jesus and said unto them, Verily, verily, I say unto you, The Son can do nothing of himself, but what he seeth the Father do: for what things soever he doeth, these also doeth the Son likewise.","words":[["Then",["G3767"]],["answered",["G611"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["and",["G2532"]],["said",["G2036"]],["unto them,",["G846"]],["Verily,",["G281"]],["verily,",["G281"]],["I say",["G3004"]],["unto you,",["G5213"]],["The Son",["G5207"]],["can",["G1410","G3756"]],["do",["G4160"]],["nothing",["G3762"]],["of",["G575"]],["himself,",["G1438"]],["but",["G3362"]],["what",["G5100"]],["he seeth",["G991"]],["the Father",["G3962"]],["do:",["G4160"]],["for",["G1063"]],["what things soever",["G3739","G302"]],["he",["G1565"]],["doeth,",["G4160"]],["these",["G5023"]],["also",["G2532"]],["doeth",["G4160"]],["the Son",["G5207"]],["likewise.",[]]]},{"verse":20,"text":"For the Father loveth the Son, and sheweth him all things that himself doeth: and he will shew him greater works than these, that ye may marvel.","words":[["For",["G1063"]],["the Father",["G3962"]],["loveth",["G5368"]],["the Son,",["G5207"]],["and",["G2532"]],["sheweth",["G1166"]],["him",["G846"]],["all things",["G3956"]],["that",["G3739"]],["himself",["G846"]],["doeth:",["G4160"]],["and",["G2532"]],["he will shew",["G1166"]],["him",["G846"]],["greater",["G3187"]],["works",["G2041"]],["than",["G3187"]],["these,",["G5130"]],["that",["G2443"]],["ye",["G5210"]],["may marvel.",[]]]},{"verse":21,"text":"For as the Father raiseth up the dead, and quickeneth them; even so the Son quickeneth whom he will.","words":[["For",["G1063"]],["as",["G5618"]],["the Father",["G3962"]],["raiseth up",["G1453"]],["the dead,",["G3498"]],["and",["G2532"]],["quickeneth",["G2227"]],["them; even",["G2532"]],["so",["G3779"]],["the Son",["G5207"]],["quickeneth",["G2227"]],["whom",["G3739"]],["he will.",[]]]},{"verse":22,"text":"For the Father judgeth no man, but hath committed all judgment unto the Son:","words":[["For",["G1063","G3761"]],["the Father",["G3962"]],["judgeth",["G2919"]],["no man,",["G3762"]],["but",["G235"]],["hath committed",["G1325"]],["all",["G3956"]],["judgment",["G2920"]],["unto the Son:",[]]]},{"verse":23,"text":"That all men should honour the Son, even as they honour the Father. He that honoureth not the Son honoureth not the Father which hath sent him.","words":[["That",["G2443"]],["all",["G3956"]],["men should honour",["G5091"]],["the Son,",["G5207"]],["even as",["G2531"]],["they honour",["G5091"]],["the Father.",["G3962"]],["He that honoureth",["G5091"]],["not",["G3361"]],["the Son",["G5207"]],["honoureth",["G5091"]],["not",["G3756"]],["the Father",["G3962"]],["which",["G3588"]],["hath sent",["G3992"]],["him.",[]]]},{"verse":24,"text":"Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that heareth my word, and believeth on him that sent me, hath everlasting life, and shall not come into condemnation; but is passed from death unto life.","words":[["Verily,",["G281"]],["verily,",["G281"]],["I say",["G3004"]],["unto you,",["G5213","G3754"]],["He that heareth",["G191"]],["my",["G3450"]],["word,",["G3056"]],["and",["G2532"]],["believeth",["G4100"]],["on him that sent",["G3992"]],["me,",["G3165"]],["hath",["G2192"]],["everlasting",["G166"]],["life,",["G2222"]],["and",["G2532"]],["shall",["G2064"]],["not",["G3756"]],["come",["G2064"]],["into",["G1519"]],["condemnation;",["G2920"]],["but",["G235"]],["is passed",["G3327"]],["from",["G1537"]],["death",["G2288"]],["unto",["G1519"]],["life.",[]]]},{"verse":25,"text":"Verily, verily, I say unto you, The hour is coming, and now is, when the dead shall hear the voice of the Son of God: and they that hear shall live.","words":[["Verily,",["G281"]],["verily,",["G281"]],["I say",["G3004"]],["unto you,",["G5213","G3754"]],["The hour",["G5610"]],["is coming,",["G2064"]],["and",["G2532"]],["now",["G3568"]],["is,",["G2076"]],["when",["G3753"]],["the dead",["G3498"]],["shall hear",["G191"]],["the voice",["G5456"]],["of the Son",["G5207"]],["of God:",["G2316"]],["and",["G2532"]],["they that hear",["G191"]],["shall live.",[]]]},{"verse":26,"text":"For as the Father hath life in himself; so hath he given to the Son to have life in himself;","words":[["For",["G1063"]],["as",["G5618"]],["the Father",["G3962"]],["hath",["G2192"]],["life",["G2222"]],["in",["G1722"]],["himself;",["G1438"]],["so",["G2532","G3779"]],["hath he given",["G1325"]],["to the Son",["G5207"]],["to have",["G2192"]],["life",["G2222"]],["in",["G1722"]],["himself;",[]]]},{"verse":27,"text":"And hath given him authority to execute judgment also, because he is the Son of man.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["hath given",["G1325"]],["him",["G846"]],["authority",["G1849"]],["to execute",["G4160"]],["judgment",["G2920"]],["also,",["G2532"]],["because",["G3754"]],["he is",["G2076"]],["the Son",["G5207"]],["of man.",[]]]},{"verse":28,"text":"Marvel not at this: for the hour is coming, in the which all that are in the graves shall hear his voice,","words":[["Marvel",["G2296"]],["not",["G3361"]],["at this:",["G5124"]],["for",["G3754"]],["the hour",["G5610"]],["is coming,",["G2064"]],["in",["G1722"]],["the which",["G3739"]],["all",["G3956"]],["that are in",["G1722"]],["the graves",["G3419"]],["shall hear",["G191"]],["his",["G846"]],["voice,",[]]]},{"verse":29,"text":"And shall come forth; they that have done good, unto the resurrection of life; and they that have done evil, unto the resurrection of damnation.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["shall come forth;",["G1607"]],["they that have done",["G4160"]],["good,",["G18"]],["unto",["G1519"]],["the resurrection",["G386"]],["of life;",["G2222"]],["and",["G1161"]],["they that have done",["G4238"]],["evil,",["G5337"]],["unto",["G1519"]],["the resurrection",["G386"]],["of damnation.",[]]]},{"verse":30,"text":"I can of mine own self do nothing: as I hear, I judge: and my judgment is just; because I seek not mine own will, but the will of the Father which hath sent me.","words":[["I",["G1473"]],["can",["G1410"]],["of",["G575"]],["mine own self",["G1683"]],["do",["G4160"]],["nothing:",["G3756","G3762"]],["as",["G2531"]],["I hear,",["G191"]],["I judge:",["G2919"]],["and",["G2532"]],["my",["G1699"]],["judgment",["G2920"]],["is",["G2076"]],["just;",["G1342"]],["because",["G3754"]],["I seek",["G2212"]],["not",["G3756"]],["mine own",["G1699"]],["will,",["G2307"]],["but",["G235"]],["the will",["G2307"]],["of the Father",["G3962"]],["which hath sent",["G3992"]],["me.",[]]]},{"verse":31,"text":"If I bear witness of myself, my witness is not true.","words":[["If",["G1437"]],["I",["G1473"]],["bear witness",["G3140"]],["of",["G4012"]],["myself,",["G1683"]],["my",["G3450"]],["witness",["G3141"]],["is",["G2076"]],["not",["G3756"]],["true.",[]]]},{"verse":32,"text":"There is another that beareth witness of me; and I know that the witness which he witnesseth of me is true.","words":[["There is",["G2076"]],["another",["G243"]],["that beareth witness",["G3140"]],["of",["G4012"]],["me;",["G1700"]],["and",["G2532"]],["I know",["G1492"]],["that",["G3754"]],["the witness",["G3141"]],["which",["G3739"]],["he witnesseth",["G3140"]],["of",["G4012"]],["me",["G1700"]],["is",["G2076"]],["true.",[]]]},{"verse":33,"text":"Ye sent unto John, and he bare witness unto the truth.","words":[["Ye",["G5210"]],["sent",["G649"]],["unto",["G4314"]],["John,",["G2491"]],["and",["G2532"]],["he bare witness",["G3140"]],["unto the truth.",[]]]},{"verse":34,"text":"But I receive not testimony from man: but these things I say, that ye might be saved.","words":[["But",["G1161"]],["I",["G1473"]],["receive",["G2983"]],["not",["G3756"]],["testimony",["G3141"]],["from",["G3844"]],["man:",["G444"]],["but",["G235"]],["these things",["G5023"]],["I say,",["G3004"]],["that",["G2443"]],["ye",["G5210"]],["might be saved.",[]]]},{"verse":35,"text":"He was a burning and a shining light: and ye were willing for a season to rejoice in his light.","words":[["He",["G1565"]],["was",["G2258"]],["a burning",["G2545"]],["and",["G2532"]],["a shining",["G5316"]],["light:",["G3088"]],["and",["G1161"]],["ye",["G5210"]],["were willing",["G2309"]],["for",["G4314"]],["a season",["G5610"]],["to rejoice",["G21"]],["in",["G1722"]],["his",["G846"]],["light.",[]]]},{"verse":36,"text":"But I have greater witness than that of John: for the works which the Father hath given me to finish, the same works that I do, bear witness of me, that the Father hath sent me.","words":[["But",["G1161"]],["I",["G1473"]],["have",["G2192"]],["greater",["G3187"]],["witness",["G3141"]],["than that of John:",["G2491"]],["for",["G1063"]],["the works",["G2041"]],["which",["G3739"]],["the Father",["G3962"]],["hath given",["G1325"]],["me",["G3427"]],["to",["G2443"]],["finish,",["G5048","G846"]],["the same",["G846"]],["works",["G2041"]],["that",["G3739"]],["I",["G1473"]],["do,",["G4160"]],["bear witness",["G3140"]],["of",["G4012"]],["me,",["G1700"]],["that",["G3754"]],["the Father",["G3962"]],["hath sent",["G649"]],["me.",[]]]},{"verse":37,"text":"And the Father himself, which hath sent me, hath borne witness of me. Ye have neither heard his voice at any time, nor seen his shape.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["the Father",["G3962"]],["himself,",["G846"]],["which hath sent",["G3992"]],["me,",["G3165"]],["hath borne witness",["G3140"]],["of",["G4012"]],["me.",["G1700"]],["Ye have",["G191"]],["neither",["G3777"]],["heard",["G191"]],["his",["G846"]],["voice",["G5456"]],["at any time,",["G4455"]],["nor",["G3777"]],["seen",["G3708"]],["his",["G846"]],["shape.",[]]]},{"verse":38,"text":"And ye have not his word abiding in you: for whom he hath sent, him ye believe not.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["ye have",["G2192"]],["not",["G3756"]],["his",["G846"]],["word",["G3056"]],["abiding",["G3306"]],["in",["G1722"]],["you:",["G5213"]],["for",["G3754"]],["whom",["G3739","G1565"]],["he hath sent,",["G649"]],["him",["G5129"]],["ye",["G5210"]],["believe",["G4100"]],["not.",[]]]},{"verse":39,"text":"Search the scriptures; for in them ye think ye have eternal life: and they are they which testify of me.","words":[["Search",["G2045"]],["the scriptures;",["G1124"]],["for",["G3754"]],["in",["G1722"]],["them",["G846"]],["ye",["G5210"]],["think",["G1380"]],["ye have",["G2192"]],["eternal",["G166"]],["life:",["G2222"]],["and",["G2532"]],["they",["G1565"]],["are they",["G1526"]],["which testify",["G3140"]],["of",["G4012"]],["me.",[]]]},{"verse":40,"text":"And ye will not come to me, that ye might have life.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["ye will",["G2309"]],["not",["G3756"]],["come",["G2064"]],["to",["G4314"]],["me,",["G3165"]],["that",["G2443"]],["ye might have",["G2192"]],["life.",[]]]},{"verse":41,"text":"I receive not honour from men.","words":[["I receive",["G2983"]],["not",["G3756"]],["honour",["G1391"]],["from",["G3844"]],["men.",[]]]},{"verse":42,"text":"But I know you, that ye have not the love of God in you.","words":[["But",["G235"]],["I know",["G1097"]],["you,",["G5209"]],["that",["G3754"]],["ye have",["G2192"]],["not",["G3756"]],["the love",["G26"]],["of God",["G2316"]],["in",["G1722"]],["you.",[]]]},{"verse":43,"text":"I am come in my Father’s name, and ye receive me not: if another shall come in his own name, him ye will receive.","words":[["I am",["G1473"]],["come",["G2064"]],["in",["G1722"]],["my",["G3450"]],["Father’s name,",["G3686"]],["and",["G2532"]],["ye receive",["G2983"]],["me",["G3165"]],["not:",["G3756"]],["if",["G1437"]],["another",["G243"]],["shall come",["G2064"]],["in",["G1722"]],["his own",["G2398"]],["name,",["G3686"]],["him",["G1565"]],["ye will receive.",[]]]},{"verse":44,"text":"How can ye believe, which receive honour one of another, and seek not the honour that cometh from God only?","words":[["How",["G4459"]],["can",["G1410"]],["ye",["G5210"]],["believe,",["G4100"]],["which receive",["G2983"]],["honour",["G1391"]],["one of another,",["G3844","G240"]],["and",["G2532"]],["seek",["G2212"]],["not",["G3756"]],["the honour",["G1391"]],["that cometh from",["G3844"]],["God",["G2316"]],["only?",[]]]},{"verse":45,"text":"Do not think that I will accuse you to the Father: there is one that accuseth you, even Moses, in whom ye trust.","words":[["Do",["G1380"]],["not",["G3361"]],["think",["G1380"]],["that",["G3754"]],["I",["G1473"]],["will accuse",["G2723"]],["you",["G5216"]],["to",["G4314"]],["the Father:",["G3962"]],["there is",["G2076"]],["one that accuseth",["G2723"]],["you,",["G5216"]],["even Moses,",["G3475"]],["in",["G1519"]],["whom",["G3739"]],["ye",["G5210"]],["trust.",[]]]},{"verse":46,"text":"For had ye believed Moses, ye would have believed me: for he wrote of me.","words":[["For",["G1063","G1487"]],["had ye believed",["G4100"]],["Moses,",["G3475"]],["ye would have believed",["G4100","G302"]],["me:",["G1698"]],["for",["G1063"]],["he",["G1565"]],["wrote",["G1125"]],["of",["G4012"]],["me.",[]]]},{"verse":47,"text":"But if ye believe not his writings, how shall ye believe my words?","words":[["But",["G1161"]],["if",["G1487"]],["ye believe",["G4100"]],["not",["G3756"]],["his",["G1565"]],["writings,",["G1121"]],["how",["G4459"]],["shall ye believe",["G4100"]],["my",["G1699"]],["words?",[]]]}]}